WEBVTT

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:34.240
The Hero Pig of Capitalism's real name is Nashimoto Keisuke.

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:37.870
This pig was manufactured by a grotesque society!

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:40.710
I carry deep feelings of pity for him.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.040
After the concert was over, I apologized to him.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.540
I'm so sorry I hit you, Nashimoto-san.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.590
It's okay, I'm an M-man after all.

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:48.420
He said the same thing as usual while laughing.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.340
I heard that he's divorced and has a child...

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:54.590
But can he really make a living by just performing with DMC?

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:57.220
I can't think on an empty stomach.
Time to get a quick bite.

00:01:57.220 --> 00:01:59.390
Welcome to our store.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.020
That will be 525 yen.

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:02.940
Thank you very much.

00:02:02.940 --> 00:02:03.940
Na-Nashimoto-san?!
Thank you very much.

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:06.270
The concert just ended, and he's already working at another job?!

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:07.770
I knew it, he's living a hectic life!

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:10.150
Good job as usual, Nashimoto-san.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:11.240
Oh, Uemura-san.

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:14.110
Your apron's on backwards. I think you're working too hard.

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.570
I'm sorry for causing you trouble.

00:02:15.570 --> 00:02:16.660
I'm a slovenly man after all.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:17.660
I have no dignity.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.540
This is the first time I've ever seen
Nashimoto-san with that expression.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:22.660
He must be in love.

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.330
I'll be heading out now.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.840
Nashimoto-san, good work tonight.

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:28.250
Kraus-?!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.460
Oh, Negishi-san.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.880
You've seen my pitiful side.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.050
I'm ashamed...

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:36.890
It looked like you and that girl got along well.

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:43.020
She's 26, and like me, divorced.
Her ex-husband left her for another woman.

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:46.520
She's such a nice girl, but I'm embarrassed to fall in love with a girl much younger than me.

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.610
Love has nothing to do with age, so fight on!

00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:49.480
Guess so.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:53.320
But there's not one thing about me that would fascinate a girl like her.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:57.240
I can't do the cool stuff you do, like playing the guitar or singing.

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:58.570
That's not true!

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:01.990
You should invite her to our next concert and show her your cool side!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:05.370
B-But if Uemura-san sees the Pig of Capitalism...

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:06.170
Not that!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:09.210
You'll be performing as yourself, not as the pig!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:13.630
You'll sing a song you made just for her and then confess your love for her!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:16.630
While that would make me happy, I'm not sure the president would approve...

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.470
Don't worry about her!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.680
Leave her to me!

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:19.890
Who's your favorite musician?

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.100
Usually, I feel nothing but pity for Nashimoto-san,
Who's your favorite musician?

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:23.020
Maekawa Kiyoshi I guess...
Usually, I feel nothing but pity for Nashimoto-san,

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:23.390
but this time, I really want him to be happy!

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.980
Please, I'm begging you this once to let the pig have the spotlight!
but this time, I really want him to be happy!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.020
Sure. Why. Not.

00:03:27.020 --> 00:03:28.150
I gave her the tickets today.

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.400
Together, we came up with a plan.
I gave her the tickets today.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.360
I think I can finish the song by the time the concert comes around.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.690
And so, the day of the concert arrived...

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.860
Old guy, y'sure you're gonna be okay?

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:35.900
This is an important period for all of us, so we're counting on you!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:36.610
Katsu curry...
This is an important period for all of us, so we're counting on you!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.030
He'll be fine. Let's go!

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:38.490
Camus!

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:39.910
Jagi-sama!

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:42.830
Nashimoto-san's really in a band...

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:44.080
They seem really popular too.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:45.000
Amazing.

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:45.960
Krauser!

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:47.920
