00:03:57.470 --> 00:04:00.220
Give that girl everything you've got!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.220
Nashimoto-san's so cool...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.180
Hey, this ain't half bad.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.060
You're doing great, Nashimoto-san!

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:15.860
