00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:56.400
Someday, I'll take you down the road towards home.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.860
D-Did he write this song for me?
Someday, I'll take you down the road towards home.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.280
We'll walk down there together...
D-Did he write this song for me?

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.740
