00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:21.800
Here it comes...!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.390
This is how you sing it!

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:23.220
There it is!
This is how you sing it!

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.510
Moving swifter than the wind!

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.140
Quieter than a forest!

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.560
