Bolder than fire itself!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:30.810
Bolder than fire itself!

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:33.650
Squealing louder than any dirty pig!

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:36.610
SPANKING FURINKATON!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.110
