00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:33.220
Oh, you spooked me there.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:35.350
I'm gonna fuck you up!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.310
To-Toshi-kun!

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.730
