00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:41.150
Shut up and take it off already!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:42.110
You're gonna stretch it out!

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:42.980
D-Don't tell me...

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.110
What's this song called?

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.740
What the fuck, Bro? You live in Tokyo and don't know DMC?!

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:47.950
