00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.830
Oh no, he totally became one of DMC's followers!

00:07:52.830 --> 00:07:54.370
Sou-kun, could you do something about him?

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.580
Hey, penetrate! Penetrate!

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.420
C'mon Toshi-kun, you can't talk like that...

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.790
