00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.420
P-Penis...?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:06.090
Sou-kun, you want some pickled kicchome?

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:09.220
When Krauser-san was a kid, he killed his parents and then raped 'em!

00:08:09.220 --> 00:08:10.720
