00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.610
I'm such a stupid and uncaring son.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.740
No, the song's over!

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.700
And Toshi-kun used to see me as his role model too!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:33.330
Big Bro, you're my hero.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:35.080
