00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.220
So fuckhead, it seems you don't go to school and you don't help out around the house.

00:09:31.220 --> 00:09:33.140
That's right! I wanna be just like you!

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.140
I don't need to do stupid shit like homework or housework!

00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:36.310
You imbecile...
I don't need to do stupid shit like homework or housework!

